Subject: [PATCH v2 3/3] jails/instances/lab-mail: File posts into lists with
 Sieve
To: Pat Maddox <pat@patmaddox.com>
Cc: lab-devel@p7x.dev
Change-Id: kmkylxlxlrusqqqtqplwroksrorysmwp
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 08:12:31 +0000

LMTP alone delivers only to INBOX, so a post waits there until Pat
moves it, and it reaches neither Fastmail nor the readers of lists
before then. The spec has Dovecot file each post into lists, which
needs a filter.

- A Sieve script from Pigeonhole files every post into lists.
- The spec names Pigeonhole and says why Sieve, not LMTP's detail
  mailbox: the detail would put lab-devel+lists@p7x.dev in
  Delivered-To instead of the list's address.
- README.org and dovecot.conf say INBOX stays empty.
